<title>USA: PairGain in technology development pact.</title>
<headline>PairGain in technology development pact.</headline>
<dateline>SACRAMENTO, Calif. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Level One Communications Inc, ADC Telecommunications Inc and PairGain Technologies Inc said Monday they would jointly develop a new standard for second-generation high-bit-rate digital subscriber line technology.</p>
<p>The three companies are developing a new technology permitting service providers to deliver information over a single twisted pair cable with the same reach and spectral compatibility of two-pair technology, a statement said.  </p>
<p>PairGain opened at 17-5/8 Friday, down 3/8; ADC at 35-1/4, down 1/8 and Level One unchanged at 35-3/4.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
